Rewrite the following using a for loop:
int i = 2;
while(i <= 10)
{
    System.out.print(i + " ");
    i += 2;
}

answerKey.modelAnswer:
for(int i = 2; i <= 10; i += 2)
{
    System.out.print(i + " ");
}

